iche to be exposed to the scripting API, and it's a good thing it's not in this PR...\r\nIsn't the code for this too invasive? It affects **TextEdit** directly for no justifiable reason, I feel.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105724#pullrequestreview-2806191405","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105724","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-30T08:20:25Z"},{"id":2793952074,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6miFNK","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105724#pullrequestreview-2793952074","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105724","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-30T14:50:09Z"},{"id":2808105582,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6nYEpu","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105724#pullrequestreview-2808105582","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105724","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-04-30T18:54:06Z"},{"id":2810618645,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6nhqMV","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"- Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/76171\r\n\r\nIdeally the color parsing and text replacing would be separated to GDScript ScriptLanguage or somewhere, but there are lots of other GDScript specific things in the script editor, so it's fine for now.\r\n\r\nParsing should make sure that it only gets color constructors and not functions that end with `Color`:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e060a7d7-1f9a-42a2-8bc6-4617f9b26ca3)\r\n\r\nThe mouse cursor should change to indicate the color box can be clicked.\r\n\r\nSelecting color objects should probably show the selection background behind it.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105724#pullrequestreview-2810618645","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105724","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-05-01T22:51:13Z"},{"id":2811833894,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6nmS4m","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","login":"Mi